message format. Note that the type of this property differs in getter and setter. See
[[getMessageFormatter()]] and [[setMessageFormatter()]] for details.";s:51:"␀phpDocumentor\Reflection\DocBlock\Description␀tags";a:0:{}}s:5:"since";N;s:8:"sinceMap";a:0:{}s:15:"deprecatedSince";N;s:16:"deprecatedReason";N;s:4:"tags";a:0:{}s:5:"todos";a:0:{}}s:13:"$translations";O:29:"yii\apidoc\models\PropertyDoc":22:{s:10:"visibility";s:6:"public";s:8:"isStatic";b:0;s:4:"type";s:5:"array";s:5:"types";a:1:{i:0;s:5:"array";}s:12:"defaultValue";N;s:6:"getter";N;s:6:"setter";N;s:9:"definedBy";s:13:"yii\i18n\I18N";s:13:"phpDocContext";r:5746;s:4:"name";s:13:"$translations";s:8:"fullName";s:28:"yii\i18n\I18N::$translations";s:10:"sourceFile";s:88:"/home/mspirkov/open-source/yiisoft/yiiframework.com/data/yii-2.0/framework/i18n/I18N.php";s:9:"startLine";i:49;s:7:"endLine";i:49;s:16:"shortDescription";s:52:"List of [[MessageSource]] configurations or objects.";s:11:"description";s:1081:"List of [[MessageSource]] configurations or objects. The array keys are message
category patterns, and the array values are the corresponding [[MessageSource]] objects or the configurations
for creating the [[MessageSource]] objects.

The message category patterns can contain the wildcard `*` at the end to match multiple categories with the same prefix.
For example, `app/*` matches both `app/cat1` and `app/cat2`.

The `*` category pattern will match all categories that do not match any other category patterns.

This property may be modified on the fly by extensions who want to have their own message sources
registered under their own namespaces.

The category `yii` and `app` are always defined. The former refers to the messages used in the Yii core
framework code, while the latter refers to the default message category for custom application code.
By default, both of these categories use [[PhpMessageSource]] and the corresponding message files are
stored under `@yii/messages` and `@app/messages`, respectively.

You may override the configuration of both categories.";s:5:"since";N;s:8:"sinceMap";a:0:{}s:15:"deprecatedSince";N;s:16:"deprecatedReason";N;s:4:"tags";a:1:{i:0;O:43:"phpDocumentor\Reflection\DocBlock\Tags\Var_":4:{s:15:"␀*␀variableName";s:0:"";s:7:"␀*␀type";O:37:"phpDocumentor\Reflection\Types\Array_":3:{s:12:"␀*␀valueType";O:37:"phpDocumentor\Reflection\Types\Mixed_":0:{}s:10:"␀*␀keyType";N;s:17:"␀*␀defaultKeyType";O:39:"phpDocumentor\Reflection\Types\Compound":2:{s:52:"␀phpDocumentor\Reflection\Types\AggregatedType␀types";a:2:{i:0;O:38:"phpDocumentor\Reflection\Types\String_":0:{}i:1;O:38:"phpDocumentor\Reflection\Types\Integer":0:{}}s:52:"␀phpDocumentor\Reflection\Types\AggregatedType␀token";s:1:"|";}}s:7:"␀*␀name";s:3:"var";s:14:"␀*␀description";O:45:"phpDocumentor\Reflection\DocBlock\Description":2:{s:59:"␀phpDocumentor\Reflection\DocBlock\Description␀bodyTemplate";s:1081:"list of [[MessageSource]] configurations or objects. The array keys are message
category patterns, and the array values are the corresponding [[MessageSource]] objects or the configurations
for creating the [[MessageSource]] objects.

The message category patterns can contain the wildcard `*` at the end to match multiple categories with the same prefix.
For example, `app/*` matches both `app/cat1` and `app/cat2`.

The `*` category pattern will match all categories that do not match any other category patterns.

This property may be modified on the fly by extensions who want to have their own message sources
registered under their own namespaces.

The category `yii` and `app` are always defined. The former refers to the messages used in the Yii core
framework code, while the latter refers to the default message category for custom application code.
By default, both of these categories use [[PhpMessageSource]] and the corresponding message files are
stored under `@yii/messages` and `@app/messages`, respectively.

You may override the configuration of both categories.";s:51:"␀phpDocumentor\Reflection\DocBlock\Description␀tags";a:0:{}}}}s:5:"todos";a:0:{}}}s:9:"namespace";s:8:"yii\i18n";s:13:"phpDocContext";r:5746;s:4:"name";s:13:"yii\i18n\I18N";s:8:"fullName";s:13:"yii\i18n\I18N";s:10:"sourceFile";s:88:"/home/mspirkov/open-source/yiisoft/yiiframework.com/data/yii-2.0/framework/i18n/I18N.php";s:9:"startLine";i:27;s:7:"endLine";i:203;s:16:"shortDescription";s:88:"I18N provides features related with internationalization (I18N) and localization (L10N).";s:11:"description";s:139:"I18N is configured as an application component in [[\yii\base\Application]] by default.
You can access that instance via `Yii::$app->i18n`.";s:5:"since";s:3:"2.0";s:8:"sinceMap";a:0:{}s:15:"deprecatedSince";N;s:16:"deprecatedReason";N;s:4:"tags";a:1:{i:0;O:47:"phpDocumentor\Reflection\DocBlock\Tags\Property":4:{s:15:"␀*␀variableName";s:16:"messageFormatter";s:7:"␀*␀type";O:38:"phpDocumentor\Reflection\Types\Object_":1:{s:45:"␀phpDocumentor\Reflection\Types\Object_␀fqsen";O:30:"phpDocumentor\Reflection\Fqsen":2:{s:37:"␀phpDocumentor\Reflection\Fqsen␀fqsen";s:26:"\yii\i18n\MessageFormatter";s:36:"␀phpDocumentor\Reflection\Fqsen␀name";s:16:"MessageFormatter";}}s:7:"␀*␀name";s:8:"property";s:14:"␀*␀description";r:6018;}}s:5:"todos";a:0:{}}s:22:"yii\i18n\GettextMoFile";O:26:"yii\apidoc\models\ClassDoc":26:{s:11:"parentClass";s:20:"yii\i18n\GettextFile";s:10:"isAbstract";b:0;s:7:"isFinal";b:0;s:10:"interfaces";a:0:{}s:6:"traits";a:0:{}s:10:"subclasses";a:0:{}s:6:"events";a:0:{}s:9:"constants";a:0:{}s:7:"authors";a:1:{s:9:"Qiang Xue";s:19:"qiang.xue@gmail.com";}s:7:"methods";a:8:{s:4:"load";O:27:"yii\apidoc\models\MethodDoc":26:{s:10:"isAbstract";b:0;s:7:"isFinal";b:0;s:8:"isStatic";b:0;s:10:"visibility";s:6:"public";s:9:"definedBy";s:22:"yii\i18n\GettextMoFile";s:10:"sourceCode";s:2216:"public function load($filePath, $context)
{
    if (false === ($fileHandle = @fopen($filePath, 'rb'))) {
        throw new Exception('Unable to read file "' . $filePath . '".');
    }
    if (false === @flock($fileHandle, LOCK_SH)) {
        throw new Exception('Unable to lock file "' . $filePath . '" for reading.');
    }
    // magic
    $array = unpack('c', $this->readBytes($fileHandle, 4));
    $magic = current($array);
    if ($magic == -34) {
        $this->useBigEndian = false;
    } elseif ($magic == -107) {
        $this->useBigEndian = true;
    } else {
        throw new Exception('Invalid MO file: ' . $filePath . ' (magic: ' . $magic . ').');
    }
    // revision
    $revision = $this->readInteger($fileHandle);
    if ($revision !== 0) {
        throw new Exception('Invalid MO file revision: ' . $revision . '.');
    }
    $count = $this->readInteger($fileHandle);
    $sourceOffset = $this->readInteger($fileHandle);
    $targetOffset = $this->readInteger($fileHandle);
    $sourceLengths = [];
    $sourceOffsets = [];
    fseek($fileHandle, $sourceOffset);
    for ($i = 0; $i < $count; ++$i) {
        $sourceLengths[] = $this->readInteger($fileHandle);
        $sourceOffsets[] = $this->readInteger($fileHandle);
    }
    $targetLengths = [];
    $targetOffsets = [];
    fseek($fileHandle, $targetOffset);
    for ($i = 0; $i < $count; ++$i) {
        $targetLengths[] = $this->readInteger($fileHandle);
        $targetOffsets[] = $this->readInteger($fileHandle);
    }
    $messages = [];
    for ($i = 0; $i < $count; ++$i) {
        $id = $this->readString($fileHandle, $sourceLengths[$i], $sourceOffsets[$i]);
        $separatorPosition = strpos((string)$id, chr(4));
        if ((!$context && $separatorPosition === false) || ($context && $separatorPosition !== false && strncmp($id, $context, $separatorPosition) === 0)) {
            if ($separatorPosition !== false) {
                $id = substr($id, $separatorPosition + 1);
            }
            $message = $this->readString($fileHandle, $targetLengths[$i], $targetOffsets[$i]);
            $messages[$id] = $message;
        }
    }
    @flock($fileHandle, LOCK_UN);
    @fclose($fileHandle);
    return $messages;
}
";s:6:"params";a:2:{s:9:"$filePath";O:26:"yii\apidoc\models\ParamDoc":8:{s:4:"name";s:9:"$filePath";s:10:"isOptional";b:0;s:12:"defaultValue";N;s:19:"isPassedByReference";b:0;s:11:"description";s:9:"File path";s:4:"type";s:6:"string";s:5:"types";a:1:{i:0;s:6:"string";}s:10:"sourceFile";s:97:"/home/mspirkov/open-source/yiisoft/yiiframework.com/data/yii-2.0/framework/i18n/GettextMoFile.php";}s:8:"$context";O:26:"yii\apidoc\models\ParamDoc":8:{s:4:"name";s:8:"$context";s:10:"isOptional";b:0;s:12:"defaultValue";N;s:19:"isPassedByReference";b:0;s:11:"description";s:15:"Message context";s:4:"type";s:6:"string";s:5:"types";a:1:{i:0;s:6:"string";}s:10:"sourceFile";s:97:"/home/mspirkov/open-source/yiisoft/yiiframework.com/data/yii-2.0/framework/i18n/GettextMoFile.php";}}s:10:"exceptions";a:1:{s:19:"\yii\base\Exception";O:45:"phpDocumentor\Reflection\DocBlock\Description":2:{s:59:"␀phpDocumentor\Reflection\DocBlock\Description␀bodyTemplate";s:29:"if unable to read the MO file";s:51:"␀phpDocumentor\Reflection\DocBlock\Description␀tags";a:0:{}}}s:6:"return";s:132:"Message translations. Array keys are source messages and array values are translated messages:
source message => translated message.";s:10:"returnType";s:5:"array";s:11:"returnTypes";a:1:{i:0;s:5:"array";}s:19:"isReturnByReference";b:0;s:13:"phpDocContext";O:38:"phpDocumentor\Reflection\Types\Context":2:{s:49:"␀phpDocumentor\Reflection\Types\Context␀namespace";s:8:"yii\i18n";s:56:"␀phpDocumentor\Reflection\Types\Context␀namespaceAliases";a:1:{s:9:"Exception";s:18:"yii\base\Exception";}}s:4:"name";s:4:"load";s:8:"fullName";s:28:"yii\i18n\GettextMoFile::load";s:10:"sourceFile";s:97:"/home/mspirkov/open-source/yiisoft/yiiframework.com/data/yii-2.0/framework/i18n/GettextMoFile.php";s:9:"startLine";i:60;s:7:"endLine";i:126;s:16:"shortDescription";s:31:"Loads messages from an MO file.";s:11:"description";s:0:"";s:5:"since";N;s:8:"sinceMap";a:0:{}s:15:"deprecatedSince";N;s:16:"deprecatedReason";N;s:4:"tags";a:0:{}s:5:"todos";a:0:{}}s:4:"save";O:27:"yii\apidoc\models\MethodDoc":26:{s:10:"isAbstract";b:0;s:7:"isFinal";b:0;s:8:"isStatic";b:0;s:10:"visibility";s:6:"public";s:9:"definedBy";s:22:"yii\i18n\GettextMoFile";s:10:"sourceCode";s:1885:"public function save($filePath, $messages)
{
    if (false === ($fileHandle = @fopen($filePath, 'wb'))) {
        throw new Exception('Unable to write file "' . $filePath . '".');
    }
    if (false === @flock($fileHandle, LOCK_EX)) {
        throw new Exception('Unable to lock file "' . $filePath . '" for reading.');
    }
    // magic
    if ($this->useBigEndian) {
        $this->writeBytes($fileHandle, pack('c*', 0x95, 0x04, 0x12, 0xde)); // -107
    } else {
        $this->writeBytes($fileHandle, pack('c*', 0xde, 0x12, 0x04, 0x95)); // -34
    }
    // revision
    $this->writeInteger($fileHandle, 0);
    // message count
    $messageCount = count($messages);
    $this->writeInteger($fileHandle, $messageCount);
    // offset of source message table
    $offset = 28;
    $this->writeInteger($fileHandle, $offset);
    $offset += $messageCount * 8;
    $this->writeInteger($fileHandle, $offset);
    // hashtable size, omitted
    $this->writeInteger($fileHandle, 0);
    $offset += $messageCount * 8;
    $this->writeInteger($fileHandle, $offset);
    // length and offsets for source messages
    foreach (array_keys($messages) as $id) {
        $length = strlen($id);
        $this->writeInteger($fileHandle, $length);
        $this->writeInteger($fileHandle, $offset);
        $offset += $length + 1;
    }
    // length and offsets for target messages
    foreach ($messages as $message) {
        $length = strlen($message);
        $this->writeInteger($fileHandle, $length);
        $this->writeInteger($fileHandle, $offset);
        $offset += $length + 1;
    }
    // source messages
    foreach (array_keys($messages) as $id) {
        $this->writeString($fileHandle, $id);
    }
    // target messages
    foreach ($messages as $message) {
        $this->writeString($fileHandle, $message);
    }
    @flock($fileHandle, LOCK_UN);
    @fclose($fileHandle);
}
