l be used to force users to enter
properly formatted data, such as phone numbers, social security numbers.

To use MaskedInput, you must set the [[mask]] property. The following example
shows how to use MaskedInput to collect phone numbers:

```
echo MaskedInput::widget([
    'name' => 'phone',
    'mask' => '999-999-9999',
]);
```

You can also use this widget in an [[ActiveForm]] using the [[ActiveField::widget()|widget()]]
method, for example like this:

```
<?= $form->field($model, 'from_date')->widget(\yii\widgets\MaskedInput::class, [
    'mask' => '999-999-9999',
]) ?>
```

The masked text field is implemented based on the
[jQuery input masked plugin](https://github.com/RobinHerbots/Inputmask).";s:5:"since";s:3:"2.0";s:8:"sinceMap";a:0:{}s:15:"deprecatedSince";N;s:16:"deprecatedReason";N;s:4:"tags";a:0:{}s:5:"todos";a:0:{}}s:20:"yii\widgets\ListView";O:26:"yii\apidoc\models\ClassDoc":26:{s:11:"parentClass";s:24:"yii\widgets\BaseListView";s:10:"isAbstract";b:0;s:7:"isFinal";b:0;s:10:"interfaces";a:0:{}s:6:"traits";a:0:{}s:10:"subclasses";a:0:{}s:6:"events";a:0:{}s:9:"constants";a:0:{}s:7:"authors";a:1:{s:9:"Qiang Xue";s:19:"qiang.xue@gmail.com";}s:7:"methods";a:4:{s:11:"renderItems";O:27:"yii\apidoc\models\MethodDoc":26:{s:10:"isAbstract";b:0;s:7:"isFinal";b:0;s:8:"isStatic";b:0;s:10:"visibility";s:6:"public";s:9:"definedBy";s:20:"yii\widgets\ListView";s:10:"sourceCode";s:583:"public function renderItems()
{
    $models = $this->dataProvider->getModels();
    $keys = $this->dataProvider->getKeys();
    $rows = [];
    foreach (array_values($models) as $index => $model) {
        $key = $keys[$index];
        if (($before = $this->renderBeforeItem($model, $key, $index)) !== null) {
            $rows[] = $before;
        }
        $rows[] = $this->renderItem($model, $key, $index);
        if (($after = $this->renderAfterItem($model, $key, $index)) !== null) {
            $rows[] = $after;
        }
    }
    return implode($this->separator, $rows);
}
