Since Version 2.0.10, the tokens `{captionOptions}` and `{contentOptions}` are available, which will represent
HTML attributes of HTML container elements for the label and value.";s:51:"␀phpDocumentor\Reflection\DocBlock\Description␀tags";a:0:{}}}}s:5:"todos";a:0:{}}s:8:"$options";O:29:"yii\apidoc\models\PropertyDoc":22:{s:10:"visibility";s:6:"public";s:8:"isStatic";b:0;s:4:"type";s:10:"array|null";s:5:"types";a:2:{i:0;s:5:"array";i:1;s:4:"null";}s:12:"defaultValue";s:68:"[
