will have the same value as [[attribute]].";s:51:"␀phpDocumentor\Reflection\DocBlock\Description␀tags";a:0:{}}}}s:5:"todos";a:0:{}}}s:9:"namespace";s:8:"yii\grid";s:13:"phpDocContext";r:26752;s:4:"name";s:19:"yii\grid\DataColumn";s:8:"fullName";s:19:"yii\grid\DataColumn";s:10:"sourceFile";s:94:"/home/mspirkov/open-source/yiisoft/yiiframework.com/data/yii-2.0/framework/grid/DataColumn.php";s:9:"startLine";i:39;s:7:"endLine";i:271;s:16:"shortDescription";s:66:"DataColumn is the default column type for the [[GridView]] widget.";s:11:"description";s:785:"It is used to show data columns and allows [[enableSorting|sorting]] and [[filter|filtering]] them.

A simple data column definition refers to an attribute in the data model of the
GridView's data provider. The name of the attribute is specified by [[attribute]].

By setting [[value]] and [[label]], the header and cell content can be customized.

A data column differentiates between the [[getDataCellValue|data cell value]] and the
[[renderDataCellContent|data cell content]]. The cell value is an un-formatted value that
may be used for calculation, while the actual cell content is a [[format|formatted]] version of that
value which may contain HTML markup.

For more details and usage information on DataColumn, see the [guide article on data widgets](guide:output-data-widgets).";s:5:"since";s:3:"2.0";s:8:"sinceMap";a:0:{}s:15:"deprecatedSince";N;s:16:"deprecatedReason";N;s:4:"tags";a:0:{}s:5:"todos";a:0:{}}s:21:"yii\grid\SerialColumn";O:26:"yii\apidoc\models\ClassDoc":26:{s:11:"parentClass";s:15:"yii\grid\Column";s:10:"isAbstract";b:0;s:7:"isFinal";b:0;s:10:"interfaces";a:0:{}s:6:"traits";a:0:{}s:10:"subclasses";a:0:{}s:6:"events";a:0:{}s:9:"constants";a:0:{}s:7:"authors";a:1:{s:9:"Qiang Xue";s:19:"qiang.xue@gmail.com";}s:7:"methods";a:1:{s:21:"renderDataCellContent";O:27:"yii\apidoc\models\MethodDoc":26:{s:10:"isAbstract";b:0;s:7:"isFinal";b:0;s:8:"isStatic";b:0;s:10:"visibility";s:9:"protected";s:9:"definedBy";s:21:"yii\grid\SerialColumn";s:10:"sourceCode";s:267:"protected function renderDataCellContent($model, $key, $index)
{
    $pagination = $this->grid->dataProvider->getPagination();
    if ($pagination !== false) {
        return (string) ($pagination->getOffset() + $index + 1);
    }
    return (string) ($index + 1);
}
