the attributes of the resulting tag. The values will be HTML-encoded using [[encode()]].
See [[renderTagAttributes()]] for details on how attributes are being rendered.
If `hiddenOptions` parameter which is another set of HTML options array is defined, it will be extracted
from `$options` to be used for the hidden input.";s:4:"type";s:5:"array";s:5:"types";a:1:{i:0;s:5:"array";}s:10:"sourceFile";s:95:"/home/mspirkov/open-source/yiisoft/yiiframework.com/data/yii-2.0/framework/helpers/BaseHtml.php";}}s:10:"exceptions";a:0:{}s:6:"return";s:23:"The generated input tag";s:10:"returnType";s:6:"string";s:11:"returnTypes";a:1:{i:0;s:6:"string";}s:19:"isReturnByReference";b:0;s:13:"phpDocContext";r:56244;s:4:"name";s:15:"activeFileInput";s:8:"fullName";s:37:"yii\helpers\BaseHtml::activeFileInput";s:10:"sourceFile";s:95:"/home/mspirkov/open-source/yiisoft/yiiframework.com/data/yii-2.0/framework/helpers/BaseHtml.php";s:9:"startLine";i:1524;s:7:"endLine";i:1543;s:16:"shortDescription";s:57:"Generates a file input tag for the given model attribute.";s:11:"description";s:354:"This method will generate the "name" and "value" tag attributes automatically for the model attribute
unless they are explicitly specified in `$options`.
Additionally, if a separate set of HTML options array is defined inside `$options` with a key named `hiddenOptions`,
it will be passed to the `activeHiddenInput` field as its own `$options` parameter.";s:5:"since";N;s:8:"sinceMap";a:0:{}s:15:"deprecatedSince";N;s:16:"deprecatedReason";N;s:4:"tags";a:0:{}s:5:"todos";a:0:{}}s:14:"activeTextarea";O:27:"yii\apidoc\models\MethodDoc":26:{s:10:"isAbstract";b:0;s:7:"isFinal";b:0;s:8:"isStatic";b:1;s:10:"visibility";s:6:"public";s:9:"definedBy";s:20:"yii\helpers\BaseHtml";s:10:"sourceCode";s:659:"public static function activeTextarea($model, $attribute, $options = [])
{
    $name = isset($options['name']) ? $options['name'] : static::getInputName($model, $attribute);
    if (isset($options['value'])) {
        $value = $options['value'];
        unset($options['value']);
    } else {
        $value = static::getAttributeValue($model, $attribute);
    }
    if (!array_key_exists('id', $options)) {
        $options['id'] = static::getInputId($model, $attribute);
    }
    self::normalizeMaxLength($model, $attribute, $options);
    static::setActivePlaceholder($model, $attribute, $options);
    return static::textarea($name, $value, $options);
}
