to [jQuery UI date format](https://api.jqueryui.com/datepicker/#utility-formatDate).";s:11:"description";s:319:"The conversion is limited to date patterns that do not use escaped characters.
Patterns like `jS \o\f F Y` which will result in a date like `1st of December 2014` may not be converted correctly
because of the use of escaped characters.

Pattern constructs that are not supported by the jQuery UI format will be removed.";s:5:"since";N;s:8:"sinceMap";a:0:{}s:15:"deprecatedSince";N;s:16:"deprecatedReason";N;s:4:"tags";a:0:{}s:5:"todos";a:0:{}}}s:10:"properties";a:2:{s:24:"$phpFallbackDatePatterns";O:29:"yii\apidoc\models\PropertyDoc":22:{s:10:"visibility";s:6:"public";s:8:"isStatic";b:1;s:4:"type";s:5:"array";s:5:"types";a:1:{i:0;s:5:"array";}s:12:"defaultValue";s:482:"[
