at represents the removal of array value while performing [[ArrayHelper::merge()]].";s:11:"description";s:398:"Usage example:

```
$array1 = [
    'ids' => [
        1,
    ],
    'validDomains' => [
        'example.com',
        'www.example.com',
    ],
];

$array2 = [
    'ids' => [
        2,
    ],
    'validDomains' => new \yii\helpers\UnsetArrayValue(),
];

$result = \yii\helpers\ArrayHelper::merge($array1, $array2);
```

The result will be

```
[
    'ids' => [
        1,
        2,
    ],
]
