detected these are kept for the next flush interval to find their pair. To prevent memory leaks, when number of
dangling messages reaches flushInterval value, logger flushes them immediately and triggers a warning.
Keep in mind that profiling-aware mode is more time and memory consuming.";s:51:"␀phpDocumentor\Reflection\DocBlock\Description␀tags";a:0:{}}}}s:5:"todos";a:0:{}}}s:9:"namespace";s:7:"yii\log";s:13:"phpDocContext";r:65202;s:4:"name";s:14:"yii\log\Logger";s:8:"fullName";s:14:"yii\log\Logger";s:10:"sourceFile";s:89:"/home/mspirkov/open-source/yiisoft/yiiframework.com/data/yii-2.0/framework/log/Logger.php";s:9:"startLine";i:42;s:7:"endLine";i:382;s:16:"shortDescription";s:102:"Logger records logged messages in memory and sends them to different targets if [[dispatcher]] is set.";s:11:"description";s:742:"A Logger instance can be accessed via `Yii::getLogger()`. You can call the method [[log()]] to record a single log message.
For convenience, a set of shortcut methods are provided for logging messages of various severity levels
via the [[Yii]] class:

- [[Yii::trace()]]
- [[Yii::error()]]
- [[Yii::warning()]]
- [[Yii::info()]]
- [[Yii::beginProfile()]]
- [[Yii::endProfile()]]

For more details and usage information on Logger, see the [guide article on logging](guide:runtime-logging).

When the application ends or [[flushInterval]] is reached, Logger will call [[flush()]]
to send logged messages to different log targets, such as [[FileTarget|file]], [[EmailTarget|email]],
or [[DbTarget|database]], with the help of the [[dispatcher]].";s:5:"since";s:3:"2.0";s:8:"sinceMap";a:0:{}s:15:"deprecatedSince";N;s:16:"deprecatedReason";N;s:4:"tags";a:3:{i:0;O:51:"phpDocumentor\Reflection\DocBlock\Tags\PropertyRead":4:{s:15:"␀*␀variableName";s:11:"dbProfiling";s:7:"␀*␀type";O:37:"phpDocumentor\Reflection\Types\Array_":3:{s:12:"␀*␀valueType";O:37:"phpDocumentor\Reflection\Types\Mixed_":0:{}s:10:"␀*␀keyType";N;s:17:"␀*␀defaultKeyType";O:39:"phpDocumentor\Reflection\Types\Compound":2:{s:52:"␀phpDocumentor\Reflection\Types\AggregatedType␀types";a:2:{i:0;O:38:"phpDocumentor\Reflection\Types\String_":0:{}i:1;O:38:"phpDocumentor\Reflection\Types\Integer":0:{}}s:52:"␀phpDocumentor\Reflection\Types\AggregatedType␀token";s:1:"|";}}s:7:"␀*␀name";s:13:"property-read";s:14:"␀*␀description";r:65648;}i:1;O:51:"phpDocumentor\Reflection\DocBlock\Tags\PropertyRead":4:{s:15:"␀*␀variableName";s:11:"elapsedTime";s:7:"␀*␀type";O:37:"phpDocumentor\Reflection\Types\Float_":0:{}s:7:"␀*␀name";s:13:"property-read";s:14:"␀*␀description";r:65674;}i:2;O:51:"phpDocumentor\Reflection\DocBlock\Tags\PropertyRead":4:{s:15:"␀*␀variableName";s:9:"profiling";s:7:"␀*␀type";O:37:"phpDocumentor\Reflection\Types\Array_":3:{s:12:"␀*␀valueType";O:37:"phpDocumentor\Reflection\Types\Mixed_":0:{}s:10:"␀*␀keyType";N;s:17:"␀*␀defaultKeyType";O:39:"phpDocumentor\Reflection\Types\Compound":2:{s:52:"␀phpDocumentor\Reflection\Types\AggregatedType␀types";a:2:{i:0;O:38:"phpDocumentor\Reflection\Types\String_":0:{}i:1;O:38:"phpDocumentor\Reflection\Types\Integer":0:{}}s:52:"␀phpDocumentor\Reflection\Types\AggregatedType␀token";s:1:"|";}}s:7:"␀*␀name";s:13:"property-read";s:14:"␀*␀description";r:65700;}}s:5:"todos";a:0:{}}s:27:"yii\log\LogRuntimeException";O:26:"yii\apidoc\models\ClassDoc":26:{s:11:"parentClass";s:18:"yii\base\Exception";s:10:"isAbstract";b:0;s:7:"isFinal";b:0;s:10:"interfaces";a:0:{}s:6:"traits";a:0:{}s:10:"subclasses";a:0:{}s:6:"events";a:0:{}s:9:"constants";a:0:{}s:7:"authors";a:1: