  Note that by using this position, the method will automatically register the jQuery js file.";s:4:"type";s:3:"int";s:5:"types";a:1:{i:0;s:3:"int";}s:10:"sourceFile";s:87:"/home/mspirkov/open-source/yiisoft/yiiframework.com/data/yii-2.0/framework/web/View.php";}s:4:"$key";O:26:"yii\apidoc\models\ParamDoc":8:{s:4:"name";s:4:"$key";s:10:"isOptional";b:1;s:12:"defaultValue";s:4:"null";s:19:"isPassedByReference";b:0;s:11:"description";s:173:"The key that identifies the JS code block. If null, it will use
