and are not treated as HTML attributes:

- `depends`: array, specifies the names of the asset bundles that this JS file depends on.
- `position`: specifies where the JS script tag should be inserted in a page. The possible values are:
    * [[POS_HEAD]]: in the head section
    * [[POS_BEGIN]]: at the beginning of the body section
    * [[POS_END]]: at the end of the body section. This is the default value.
- `appendTimestamp`: bool whether to append a timestamp to the URL.

Please refer to [[Html::jsFile()]] for other supported options.";s:4:"type";s:5:"array";s:5:"types";a:1:{i:0;s:5:"array";}s:10:"sourceFile";s:87:"/home/mspirkov/open-source/yiisoft/yiiframework.com/data/yii-2.0/framework/web/View.php";}s:4:"$key";O:26:"yii\apidoc\models\ParamDoc":8:{s:4:"name";s:4:"$key";s:10:"isOptional";b:1;s:12:"defaultValue";s:4:"null";s:19:"isPassedByReference";b:0;s:11:"description";s:335:"The key that identifies the JS script file. If null, it will use
