This parameter is ignored if [[serializer]] is `false`.";s:4:"type";s:28:"\yii\caching\Dependency|null";s:5:"types";a:2:{i:0;s:23:"\yii\caching\Dependency";i:1;s:4:"null";}s:10:"sourceFile";s:92:"/home/mspirkov/open-source/yiisoft/yiiframework.com/data/yii-2.0/framework/caching/Cache.php";}}s:10:"exceptions";a:0:{}s:6:"return";s:29:"Result of $callable execution";s:10:"returnType";s:5:"mixed";s:11:"returnTypes";a:1:{i:0;s:5:"mixed";}s:19:"isReturnByReference";b:0;s:13:"phpDocContext";r:125687;s:4:"name";s:8:"getOrSet";s:8:"fullName";s:27:"yii\caching\Cache::getOrSet";s:10:"sourceFile";s:92:"/home/mspirkov/open-source/yiisoft/yiiframework.com/data/yii-2.0/framework/caching/Cache.php";s:9:"startLine";i:602;s:7:"endLine";i:614;s:16:"shortDescription";s:183:"Method combines both [[set()]] and [[get()]] methods to retrieve value identified by a $key,
or to store the result of $callable execution if there is no cache available for the $key.";s:11:"description";s:301:"Usage example:

```
public function getTopProducts($count = 10) {
    $cache = $this->cache; // Could be Yii::$app->cache
    return $cache->getOrSet(['top-n-products', 'n' => $count], function () use ($count) {
        return Products::find()->mostPopular()->limit($count)->all();
    }, 1000);
}
