being deleted is outdated.";s:51:"␀phpDocumentor\Reflection\DocBlock\Description␀tags";a:0:{}}s:10:"\Throwable";O:45:"phpDocumentor\Reflection\DocBlock\Description":2:{s:59:"␀phpDocumentor\Reflection\DocBlock\Description␀bodyTemplate";s:22:"in case delete failed.";s:51:"␀phpDocumentor\Reflection\DocBlock\Description␀tags";a:0:{}}}s:6:"return";s:195:"The number of rows deleted, or `false` if the deletion is unsuccessful for some reason.
Note that it is possible the number of rows deleted is 0, even though the deletion execution is successful.";s:10:"returnType";s:9:"int|false";s:11:"returnTypes";a:2:{i:0;s:3:"int";i:1;s:5:"false";}s:19:"isReturnByReference";b:0;s:13:"phpDocContext";r:159117;s:4:"name";s:6:"delete";s:8:"fullName";s:27:"yii\db\ActiveRecord::delete";s:10:"sourceFile";s:94:"/home/mspirkov/open-source/yiisoft/yiiframework.com/data/yii-2.0/framework/db/ActiveRecord.php";s:9:"startLine";i:760;s:7:"endLine";i:783;s:16:"shortDescription";s:58:"Deletes the table row corresponding to this active record.";s:11:"description";s:353:"This method performs the following steps in order:

1. call [[beforeDelete()]]. If the method returns `false`, it will skip the
   rest of the steps;
2. delete the record from the database;
3. call [[afterDelete()]].

In the above step 1 and 3, events named [[EVENT_BEFORE_DELETE]] and [[EVENT_AFTER_DELETE]]
will be raised by the corresponding methods.";s:5:"since";N;s:8:"sinceMap";a:0:{}s:15:"deprecatedSince";N;s:16:"deprecatedReason";N;s:4:"tags";a:0:{}s:5:"todos";a:0:{}}s:14:"deleteInternal";O:27:"yii\apidoc\models\MethodDoc":26:{s:10:"isAbstract";b:0;s:7:"isFinal";b:0;s:8:"isStatic";b:0;s:10:"visibility";s:9:"protected";s:9:"definedBy";s:19:"yii\db\ActiveRecord";s:10:"sourceCode";s:676:"protected function deleteInternal()
{
    if (!$this->beforeDelete()) {
        return false;
    }
    // we do not check the return value of deleteAll() because it's possible
    // the record is already deleted in the database and thus the method will return 0
    $condition = $this->getOldPrimaryKey(true);
    $lock = $this->optimisticLock();
    if ($lock !== null) {
        $condition[$lock] = $this->$lock;
    }
    $result = static::deleteAll($condition);
    if ($lock !== null && !$result) {
        throw new StaleObjectException('The object being deleted is outdated.');
    }
    $this->setOldAttributes(null);
    $this->afterDelete();
    return $result;
}
