or update them if they do.";s:11:"description";s:295:"For example,

```
$sql = $queryBuilder->upsert('pages', [
    'name' => 'Front page',
    'url' => 'https://example.com/', // url is unique
    'visits' => 0,
], [
    'visits' => new \yii\db\Expression('visits + 1'),
], $params);
```

The method will properly escape the table and column names.";s:5:"since";s:6:"2.0.14";s:8:"sinceMap";a:0:{}s:15:"deprecatedSince";N;s:16:"deprecatedReason";N;s:4:"tags";a:0:{}s:5:"todos";a:0:{}}s:6:"update";O:27:"yii\apidoc\models\MethodDoc":26:{s:10:"isAbstract";b:0;s:7:"isFinal";b:0;s:8:"isStatic";b:0;s:10:"visibility";s:6:"public";s:9:"definedBy";s:14:"yii\db\Command";s:10:"sourceCode";s:217:"public function update($table, $columns, $condition = '', $params = [])
